    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">BECOME WHAT YOU HAVE IMAGINED</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In Rock Simulator 2, you\u2019re more than just a collector. You\u2019re an observer of time and nature. Unlock over 100 different rocks, each representing a piece of the world around us. <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1949770/extras/f7e8467afb93ebdad6aa41290c62c2b3.poster.avif?t=1742078990\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1949770/extras/f7e8467afb93ebdad6aa41290c62c2b3.webm?t=1742078990\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1949770/extras/f7e8467afb93ebdad6aa41290c62c2b3.mp4?t=1742078990\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">LEVELING</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Growth is not a race. Unlock and upgrade your rocks, and with each step forward, learn to appreciate the slow and methodical pace.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">MULTIPLAYER</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience peaceful environments with friends. There\u2019s no pressure here. Sit together in silence or chat while watching the sun dip below the horizon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1949770/extras/5674d892dc21e32e4af116610a47d550.poster.avif?t=1742078990\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1949770/extras/5674d892dc21e32e4af116610a47d550.webm?t=1742078990\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1949770/extras/5674d892dc21e32e4af116610a47d550.mp4?t=1742078990\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">WEATHER</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Join friends in serene environments, watching the sun sink below the horizon. No need for words. A quiet acknowledgment of existence and connection. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">AMBIENCE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Let the soundscapes guide you. Listen to rain, wind, or gentle music as you immerse yourself in the present.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">LEADERBOARD</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Success is not only measured by speed but by endurance. How long can you simply <i>be</i>? The leaderboard honors those who understand that existing fully in each moment is an achievement of its own.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">PUZZLES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There\u2019s something hidden in the rocks.  Be curious. Pay attention. The answers reveal themselves to those who truly look.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">BECOME WHAT YOU HAVE IMAGINED</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In Rock Simulator 2, you\u2019re more than just a collector. You\u2019re an observer of time and nature. Unlock over 100 different rocks, each representing a piece of the world around us. <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1949770/extras/f7e8467afb93ebdad6aa41290c62c2b3.poster.avif?t=1742078990\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1949770/extras/f7e8467afb93ebdad6aa41290c62c2b3.webm?t=1742078990\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1949770/extras/f7e8467afb93ebdad6aa41290c62c2b3.mp4?t=1742078990\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">LEVELING</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Growth is not a race. Unlock and upgrade your rocks, and with each step forward, learn to appreciate the slow and methodical pace.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">MULTIPLAYER</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience peaceful environments with friends. There\u2019s no pressure here. Sit together in silence or chat while watching the sun dip below the horizon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1949770/extras/5674d892dc21e32e4af116610a47d550.poster.avif?t=1742078990\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1949770/extras/5674d892dc21e32e4af116610a47d550.webm?t=1742078990\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1949770/extras/5674d892dc21e32e4af116610a47d550.mp4?t=1742078990\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">WEATHER</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Join friends in serene environments, watching the sun sink below the horizon. No need for words. A quiet acknowledgment of existence and connection. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">AMBIENCE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Let the soundscapes guide you. Listen to rain, wind, or gentle music as you immerse yourself in the present.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">LEADERBOARD</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Success is not only measured by speed but by endurance. How long can you simply <i>be</i>? The leaderboard honors those who understand that existing fully in each moment is an achievement of its own.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">PUZZLES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There\u2019s something hidden in the rocks.  Be curious. Pay attention. The answers reveal themselves to those who truly look.</p>",
    "short_description": "Rock Simulator 2 is a multiplayer, meditative idle game for relaxation and discovery. Start in the Hideaway, a peaceful retreat where you collect and appreciate nature\u2019s creations. Unwind with friends, shape your environment, and enjoy the quiet beauty of the world around you.",
